{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3d2299705ebeed5e436b4de0047e0848d2c12540aebcf1ff11e63a83b9602a94", "ja": "（LOVERS HEARTの集大成ライブは\n大成功で終わり、劇場にいつもの日常が戻ってきた）", "zh": "（LOVERS HEART的收官演唱会圆满成功，剧场也恢复了往日的日常。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "713e256a3292fc1cdc407ee07b9c6caf1de4049aff2e1787b8b2e286f1a18d5e", "ja": "ふふ……♪", "zh": "呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c96bfa8c498d50863512e42cf10c5e8f6ab630be465987aa8b889f6018f7ddb2", "ja": "？　この声は……。", "zh": "？这个声音是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "2512a90ecb0953334fd828e25fda452ece587ae043c4b81d5e3a3777252aa742", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e21cc4af32bc7f67a7af2ffb3d07a81d9f8c50961836630f133f241fb89f84be", "ja": "やっぱり紗代子か、お疲れ様。\n機嫌がよさそうだけど、なにかいい事でもあったのか？", "zh": "果然是纱代子啊，辛苦了。\n你心情好像挺不错的，是有什么好事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "23e7057e9bd0a7a0234b8abce2ce80011558e20e20303f6d3ced3a7b7bd35e54", "ja": "あっ、わかりますか？\n実は昨日、新しいメガネが届いたんです！", "zh": "啊，你看出来了吗？\n其实昨天，新眼镜送到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "47ce6e0e6a4532a077e9820d0855c2096426d52ab5a66a4ff4e5d164d3823946", "ja": "ツアー先で行ったお店に、すごく素敵なものがあって。\n悩んだんですけど、思いきって買っちゃいました。", "zh": "巡演时去的店里，有件特别棒的东西。\n虽然纠结了一番，但还是下定决心买下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f32ef5e6aa8e9feaa3c2a93b1c3605a526d5a77e5211cce157807e44359b5ec2", "ja": "メガネか……確かに、安い買い物じゃないな。\n気に入ったものがあったなら、良かった。", "zh": "眼镜啊……确实不是一笔小开销。能买到喜欢的东西就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "050539b4856e863ec0a3d7a926533afc4fc3188a839baa2a17484c87d008bc4c", "ja": "私も最初は、見るだけのつもりだったんです。\nでも、素敵なフレームがたくさんあって……。", "zh": "我一开始也只是打算看看的。不过，有好多漂亮的镜框……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "e46b2cc94fe320d9b4a3b870b35a699bb254e79989bc833bacc628e83507eb8d", "ja": "一緒に行った春香さんと百合子が、\nすごく楽しそうにメガネを選んでたんです。", "zh": "和一起去的春香和百合子，挑选眼镜时看起来特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "0237901238d584a4203bfbfd40c02eb7c0fd30bc70b5fa2e7fddcea932d20ced", "ja": "それを見ていたら、\nメガネも、悪くないかな……なんて。", "zh": "看着她们那样，\n我也觉得戴眼镜……好像也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2d41317d5952d9ff7a56b60483b62387fe018eac25a569d57462d71f15b04f3d", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\nメガネ、いいと思うぞ！", "zh": "嗯，确实呢。\n我觉得眼镜很不错哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1012_p", "source_sha256": "949d8e57a1600dc2c9108e995dbd76eadcaa4a68d78c54a6385bdbd3dba605be", "ja": "けど、そんなに気に入ってるのに、\n今日は掛けてこなかったんだな。", "zh": "不过，明明那么喜欢，今天却没戴来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "09255be5674e0101daa5888baf10813dc3ae3d7f7d99ce070a4ba81aa5b4f5dd", "ja": "それが……自分でまだちょっと見慣れなくて、\nなんだか恥ずかしくて……。", "zh": "只是……我自己还没太习惯，总觉得有点不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "dc23edbad093a2d206a482f52cc7eba02eab1a37cd4f946eb650c268fa4100e6", "ja": "だから、出かける時に掛けたりして、\n少しずつ慣らして行こうかなって思ってるんです。", "zh": "所以，我想着出门的时候戴上它，慢慢习惯起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4833847d40851017b302bb0800a14b3ece2af973abbee0078169a649cea2b816", "ja": "はは、そうだったのか。\nじゃあいつか、見られるのを楽しみにしてるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这样啊。那我就期待着有一天能看到吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "8014d8cb390a6fb5c17c65b6f2e919df7d8f0c0e1adfe6409413f1f99ba64974", "ja": "……あの。{$P$}。\nだったら、次のお休み、付き合ってもらえませんか？", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}。\n那么，下次休息日，能陪我一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "9cc02ea3101c1af3f11295bb87492f1bdca2addefd2c523616841babda4cd406", "ja": "私が新しいメガネに慣れるまで、\n特訓に付き合ってほしいんです！", "zh": "我想请你陪我练习，直到我适应新眼镜为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1018_p", "source_sha256": "358a7737a48a070d91e529fbf8623b7d4c27b9d8ebdf053fd2c14f6f44c61c1a", "ja": "特訓は大袈裟な気もするけど……\nそれくらい、いくらでも付き合うよ。", "zh": "虽然说是特训，感觉有点夸张……\n不过这点程度，我随时都可以陪你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0303_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "13e3e6ca5ab7177334cd951e8081f37aa23e931661e20d9e872b71bafe16e6ba", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\n……早く慣れるように、がんばりますね♪", "zh": "非常感谢您！\n……为了能早点适应，我会努力的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
